    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) will start with the Framing phase, which involves understanding The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) specific requirements and defining the project scope, timelines, and budget. the Framing phase, which involves understanding CHRB's specific requirements and defining the project scope, timelines, and budget will be followed by the Design phase, where The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) will design a non-decisional support tool that facilitates access to information, improves the quality of written outputs, and reduces processing and documentation times." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) consortium partner, Ligeo Santé, a health-IT integrator, will be instrumental in ensuring SIH/DPI integration and FHIR/INS interoperability work." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) partnership with OuraneCloud, a French sovereign cloud provider, will guarantee secure hosting of the solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of governance, The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) will establish a joint steering committee with The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB), meeting monthly, and an operational committee meeting fortnightly." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "A single accountable project director will serve as the client's point of contact, and The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) will maintain a RACI matrix to ensure clear roles and responsibilities." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For pilot phase, The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) anticipate a duration of approximately 3-4 months, with the following key milestones:  - Completion of the Framing and Design phases - Development of a functional prototype - Testing and validation with a small group of hospital staff progressive rollout will follow the successful completion of pilot phase, with incremental deployments to larger user groups over the next 12-18 months." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) dedicated team, including a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead, will work closely with The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) to ensure smooth delivery." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) available capacity, The Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) can dedicate the necessary resources to ensure successful project delivery within the estimated global budget of €900,000 over 5 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "However, I do not have information on the specific breakdown of costs or detailed timelines beyond pilot phase and general rollout strategy." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution must provide hospital staff with an intelligent assistance tool that supports clinical-administrative activities, including information retrieval, drafting medical and administrative documents, handling dossiers, and facilitating continuity of care." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution must integrate with the existing hospital information system (SIH) and electronic patient record (DPI), support health interoperability standards (HL7 / FHIR), and provide response times below 2 seconds for common queries." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our current technology stack, what is the proposed architecture for The expected solution, and how will our ensure high availability (99.9%), data sovereignty, and compliance with SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure or equivalent? the proposed architecture for this solution solution is based on our Atelier platform, a Retrieval-augmented generation platform that can be integrated with the hospital's existing SIH and DPI systems through standard connectors and custom adapters." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The platform will utilize The platform API-first design to embed intelligent assistance tools within the hospital staff's workflow, supporting clinical-administrative activities such as information retrieval and document drafting." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure high availability of 99.9%, our will deploy The expected solution on our Sovereign HDS tier hosted by OuraneCloud, which provides active-active redundancy across two availability zones." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
