    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure strict GDPR compliance and meet The tender requirements, The solution should maintain The solution focus on these existing security controls and certifications, particularly emphasizing the use of OuraneCloud, a SecNumCloud-qualified sovereign cloud for hosting within the European Union, ensuring no data transfer outside the European Union, and highlighting The solution capabilities in encryption, pseudonymisation, explainability, and traceability." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message7> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The tender requires compliance with various regulatory obligations, including GDPR, HDS certification, and medical confidentiality (secret médical)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must be designed as an assistance tool, with no clinical or medico-administrative decision automated without explicit validation by a qualified professional." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given our company's legal standing, procurement experience across EU jurisdictions, IP model, insurance, standard contractual clauses, and AI regulatory posture (GDPR, EU AI Act) as of 2024, what are the key legal risks our company's need to flag, and how can our company's ensure compliance with the key legal risks we need to flag?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "As the Legal Agent for our company's, the Legal Agent for Faber IA have reviewed our company's context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk136> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Given the requirements, the key legal risks we need to flag include ensuring GDPR compliance, particularly with Article 9 special-category data and Article 28 processing agreements, maintaining medical confidentiality, obtaining HDS certification if necessary, and adhering to EU AI Act requirements for AI systems used in a health context." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk137> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure compliance with the key legal risks we need to flag, our company's must maintain our company's Security & Compliance function's monitoring of the obligations related to GDPR, medical confidentiality, HDS framework, and EU AI Act requirements. our company's already has experience with French public procurement, including standard administrative attestations and contractual clauses such as reversibility clauses, service-level commitments, penalties, and audit rights. our company's intellectual property model, which includes proprietary software licensed under a subscription/usage model and the use of open-source components under permissive licenses, must be carefully managed to avoid any licensing conflicts. our company's also need to ensure that our company's AI models' licensing terms, including those for sovereign European open-weight models and proprietary third-party models, comply with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk138> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It is essential to note that our company's have professional liability insurance covering up to 10 million euros per claim and general civil liability cover, which can mitigate some of the risks associated with non-compliance. our company's certificates of insurance are available upon request." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk139> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of specific compliance measures, our company's reversibility plan must provide for the return and deletion of client data at the end of the contract, ensuring that client data ownership is respected." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk14> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must assist staff in analysing and handling dossiers by surfacing relevant information, recalling applicable rules, and suggesting actions or verifications." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk140> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Furthermore, where a use case approaches the medical-device threshold, our Security & Compliance function's must flag CE/MDR implications and consequences for liability and positioning to ensure our company's operate within the defined regulatory boundaries." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk141> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Overall, while there are several legal risks associated with The tender, our company's existing experience, compliance measures, and insurance coverage provide a solid foundation for managing several legal risks associated with this tender and ensuring regulatory compliance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message9> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk142> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The global budget allocated to the project is estimated at 900,000 over 5 years." ;
