    <http://example.org/node/chunk147> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "One cost-optimisation strategy is to favour the sovereign HDS tier and the sovereign European model, as the sovereign HDS tier and the sovereign European model are more cost-efficient on the recurring side compared to the premium high-availability tier combined with top-tier proprietary inference." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk148> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By choosing the sovereign HDS tier and the sovereign European model where requirements allow, the authority's can reduce hosting and inference costs, which are the authority's main recurring cost drivers." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk149> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, the authority's maintain a five-year cost model that can be re-run if requirements or budget change, allowing the authority's to adapt and ensure the project remains within budget. the authority's approach will prioritize configurations that protect the gross margin and recurring-cost predictability, enabling the authority's to deliver the project successfully while controlling annual operating costs." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message11> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk15> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must support medical coding (PMSI / ICD-10) for activity reporting (T2A)." ;
